  "scope": "Versioned public network-setting mutations bind predecessor public bookkeeping and require one replaceable atomic task/source/owner/site-bound application receipt. Commit seal is in the adapter-specific result identity; shared EffectReceipts semantics and schemas are unchanged. Covers all six setting types, logical/schema duplicates, quota, pruning, legacy tasks and no-op imports. Final actual API and two-revision lab qualification logs distinguish native APIs from simulated storage/actors. No native-value baseline, creator/adoption/delete authority, physical rollout or full pinned-model parity claim."
